WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.882
Their answer is A View From Somewhere, or AVFS.

00:00:03.963 --> 00:00:07.845
They collect a dataset of six hundred thirty-eight
thousand triplet similarity judgments

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:11.808
over nearly five thousand faces,

00:00:11.888 --> 00:00:15.770
and crucially,

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.733
each judgment records the identity and
self-reported demographics of the annotator who made it.

00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:23.695
On top of this data they build a conditional
learning framework that produces a continuous,

00:00:23.775 --> 00:00:27.658
low-dimensional, and human-interpretable embedding space,

00:00:27.738 --> 00:00:31.620
along with per-annotator masks that reveal how
different people weigh different visual dimensions.
